{
  "info": {
    "name": "SAV Platform API",
    "_postman_id": "sav-platform-api-v1",
    "description": "Collection complète pour tester l'API de la plateforme de gestion SAV.\n\n**Workflow recommandé :**\n1. Exécuter **Login (Admin)** → le token est sauvegardé automatiquement\n2. Tester les routes Admin/Tickets\n3. Exécuter **Login (Technicien)** pour les routes technicien\n4. Exécuter **Login (Client)** pour les routes client\n\n**Base URL :** `http://127.0.0.1:8000/api`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url",        "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token_admin",     "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token_tech",      "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token_client",    "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "ticket_id",       "value": "1",  "type": "string" },
    { "key": "technicien_id",   "value": "2",  "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [

    {
      "name": "🔐 Authentification",
      "description": "Inscription, connexion et déconnexion. Le token Bearer est automatiquement sauvegardé dans les variables de collection.",
      "item": [

        {
          "name": "Register – Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token_admin', json.token);",
                  "    pm.test('Account created', () => pm.expect(json.token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept",       "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Admin Principal\",\n  \"email\": \"admin@sav.test\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"password123\",\n  \"role\": \"Admin\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/register", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["register"] },
            "description": "Crée un compte Admin. Valeurs acceptées pour `role` : `Admin`, `Technicien`, `Client`."
          }
        },

        {
          "name": "Register – Technicien",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token_tech', json.token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('technicien_id', json.user.id);",
                  "    pm.test('Technicien created', () => pm.expect(json.token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept",       "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Ahmed Technicien\",\n  \"email\": \"tech@sav.test\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"password123\",\n  \"role\": \"Technicien\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/register", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["register"] }
          }
        },

